; ==========================================
; CHALLENGE 2: Rocket Launch Countdown
; Language: Cantonese / 粵語 (yue)
; ==========================================
; Count down from 5 to 1, then launch!

搬 counter 5

launch_loop:
叫系統 counter
減 counter 1
比 counter 0
如果唔等 launch_loop

; Blastoff!
搬 box 999
叫系統 box
